// On-chain instruction-builder golden tests.
//
// Reinstates the byte-level coverage lost when session-on-chain.test.ts,
// session-server-on-chain.test.ts, and payment-channels-open-ix.test.ts were
// deleted in the cascade/MPP session rework: the settleAndSeal / topUp /
// distribute / reclaim builders in `server/session/on-chain.ts` and the
// client open builder in `client/PaymentChannels.ts` are pinned against
// golden account lists (pubkeys + signer/writable flags, in order) and
// golden instruction data bytes for a fixed deterministic fixture.
//
// The goldens were generated by running the CURRENT builders once (this PR
// added `openSlot` to the open instruction, so pre-PR goldens are stale) —
// from here on any drift in account ordering, roles, PDA derivation, or
// data encoding fails these tests. Structural assertions (discriminators,
// field offsets, PDA recomputation) accompany the byte diffs so a failure
// explains itself rather than just dumping hex.

